/P 842 0 R
/E (Project overview - The Medical Diagnosis Center by Service Portal \(ServiceNow\) project focuses on developing a digital healthcare service portal to manage patient services, appointments, diagnostic requests, and medical records efficiently. The solution enables patients to submit service requests, track appointment status, access diagnostic information, and communicate with healthcare teams through a user-friendly ServiceNow Service Portal interface. It improves healthcare service delivery by automating workflows, managing requests, and providing better coordination between patients, doctors, and support staff. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
